<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #333;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px;"/>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">AMRITA</h1>
        <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">VISHWA VIDYAPEETHAM</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">School of Engineering</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Coimbatore Campus, Amritanagar P.O., Ettimadai,</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India Pin: 641 042</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Fax: +91 422 268274 Email: ase@amrita.edu</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">AMRITA/CBE/SOE/05/2022/03</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Date: <span data-field="document_date">{{ document_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">OFFICE COMMUNICATION</h2>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Subject: AY <span data-field="academic_year">{{ academic_year }}</span> Odd Semester Class Commencement Dates for all UG & PG programs</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">This is to inform you that the commencement of classes for the odd semester of all UG and PG programmes for the Academic year <span data-field="academic_year">{{ academic_year }}</span>, as per the schedule given below:</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Name of the Program</th>
        <th style="width: 60%;">Odd Semester <span data-field="semester_year">{{ semester_year }}</span> Class Commencement Date</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in program_schedule %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="program_schedule[{{ loop.index0 }}].program_name">{{ item.program_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="program_schedule[{{ loop.index0 }}].commencement_date">{{ item.commencement_date }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">To:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-left: 20px;">All Chairpersons – ASE, Amrita Darshanam, Dept. of Mass Communication and Dept. of Social Work</p>

    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 20px;">Copy to:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-left: 20px;">Registrar; Principle Director, CIR; Campus Director, Dean – PGP, Chairperson – PG Programmes; Deputy Controller of Examinations; Chief Warden; Professor – Students’ Welfare; Director-ICTS; Academic Coordinator; Academic Administrative Office; AUMS; Dept. of Physical Education; Library; General Administration; Br. Nikileshamrita Chaitanya –Kitchen; Canteen; Reception; Head Security; Clinic</p>

    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 30px;">For information:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-left: 20px;">Pro-Chancellor's Office</p>
  </div>
</div>